y bucket list ...\n:-)"},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2020-03-22 21:41:28","text":"[https://www.flickr.com/photos/italobikes-v2jo] That was a fun trip with [https://www.flickr.com/photos/26941526@N00] on the Galloping Goose Trail to Sooke, BC.  He, Steph and I have discussed an idea we called the \"VicTownsend International Bike Loop\" which has yet to achieve any fame, but you can see the route here: earthwandering.com/victownsendinternationalbikeloop/  I have done all of the segments several times, but never the whole loop in one go.  It is an extraordinary region for biking using ferries.  The Olympic Discovery Trail is still be actively built, but the whole route can be bike with some on car road segments.  The info is here: olympicdiscoverytrail.org/"}],"description":"","detail":"photos/0102.json","filename":"27887381286_e9811fa23b_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/27887381286/","height":3000,"id":"27887381286","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/27887381286/27887381286_e9811fa23b_o.jpg","sha256":"23bd7ba7cf31820b7ffb75d590fef30e74d4faffb0a54567b5943d258d7abf5d","tags":[],"taken":"2016-04-16 17:17:53","title":"IMG_3326","uploaded":"2016-06-26 13:45:08","width":4000},"27891962970":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":6143},{"id":"72157670140405881","position":1}],"bytes":2999716,"camera_position":6143,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0102.json","filename":"27891962970_eeea534933_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/27891962970/","height":2300,"id":"27891962970","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/27891962970/27891962970_eeea534933_o.jpg","sha256":"6c8fd37db7d801da6cbd88c20c681f826fdcbd228a1519a45b9084b0cfb052be","tags":[],"taken":"2016-06-04 20:30:38","title":"IMG_5455","uploaded":"2016-07-08 07:23:10","width":3294},"27892863130":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":6165}],"bytes":3668216,"camera